@startuml
title OmniTrade AI - UML component design with interfaces
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam componentStyle uml2
actor Analyst
component "Web GUI" as GUI
component "Public API" as API
component "Workflow Designer" as Designer
component "Workflow Runtime" as Runtime
component "Evidence Service" as Evidence
component "Model Gateway" as Model
component "Report & Lineage" as Report
component "Ownership Repository" as Repo
component "Event Transport" as Events
component "Artifact Store" as Artifacts
component "External Evidence Adapters" as ExtEvidence
component "External Model Adapters" as ExtModel
Analyst --> GUI
GUI ..> API : <<IUserAPI>>
API ..> Designer : <<IWorkflowDraft>>
API ..> Runtime : <<IRunCommand>>
GUI ..> Events : <<IRunEvent>>
Runtime ..> Events : <<IRunEvent>> publish
Runtime ..> Evidence : <<IEvidence>>
Runtime ..> Model : <<IModel>>
Runtime ..> Report : <<IReport>>
API ..> Repo : <<IRepository>>
Designer ..> Repo : <<IRepository>>
Runtime ..> Repo : <<IRepository>>
Evidence ..> Repo : <<IRepository>>
Report ..> Repo : <<IRepository>>
Evidence ..> ExtEvidence : <<adapter>>
Model ..> ExtModel : <<adapter>>
Report ..> Artifacts : <<IArtifact>>
note bottom of Runtime
Owns validation, readiness, joins, failure policy,
budgets, checkpoints, and legal state transitions.
end note
@enduml
